				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "# Early\nTactical-Tools includes its own simplified pragma based facility for participating in the [[StartUp/ShutDown Process]] that does not require explicit registration. As part of this there is also a pragma for methods that adjust the environment early in the startup process. \n• {{gtPragma:ttOSEnvironment}}  {{gtClass:TTFixUpOSEnvironment}} is extensible, or you can make a copy for your own project."
